ce floor.\n\nCamera Lens Information: A 50mm lens is used to achieve a natural perspective and depth of field, keeping the dancers in sharp focus while slightly blurring the background crowd for emphasis.\n\nCamera Angle: The camera is positioned at eye level with the dancers, providing an intimate view of their performance and the surrounding audience.\n\nTime of Day: The scene is set at night, enhancing the nightclub's vibrant and energetic atmosphere.\n\nDetailed Description of Character and Emotion: The dog and cat are elegantly dressed, with the dog wearing a sleek tuxedo and the cat in a flowing, red tango dress. Their expressions are focused and passionate, embodying the intensity and grace of the tango. The crowd of cats and dogs is animated and joyful, their eyes wide with excitement and paws clapping in rhythm with the music."]},{"id":133,"type":"Griptape Combine: Rules List","pos":[-1960,400],"size":[352.79998779296875,66],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"rules_1","name":"rules_1","shape":7,"type":"RULESET","link":210},{"name":"rules_2","type":"RULESET","link":211},{"name":"rules_3","type":"RULESET","link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"RULESET","name":"RULESET","type":"RULESET","links":[212]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-griptape","ver":"2a70afd0f3d6118969cd40565e07376105661a21","Node name for S&R":"Griptape Combine: Rules List"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":89,"type":"Griptape Create: Rules","pos":[-1960,340],"size":[400,200],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"RULES","name":"RULES","type":"RULESET","links":[211]},{"localized_name":"NAME","name":"NAME","type":"STRING","links":null}],"title":"General Rules","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-griptape","ver":"2a70afd0f3d6118969cd40565e07376105661a21","Node name for S&R":"Griptape Create: Rules"},"widgets_values":["My rules","You are an expert in creating image generation rules that are high quality and very